msgid "Generate Gramps Web API key"
msgstr "產生 Gramps Web API 金鑰"

msgid "Server URL"
msgstr "伺服器網址"

msgid "e.g. https://your-server/api"
msgstr "例如 https://your-server/api"

msgid "Username"
msgstr "使用者名稱"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "密碼"

msgid "Generate API Key"
msgstr "產生 API 金鑰"

msgid ""
"Enter your server URL, username, and password, then click Generate API Key."
msgstr "輸入伺服器網址、使用者名稱及密碼，然後按一下 [產生 API 金鑰]。"

msgid "GRAMPS_WEB_API_KEY"
msgstr "GRAMPS_WEB_API_KEY"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "複製"

msgid "Create Synced Family Tree for this key"
msgstr "用此金鑰建立同步的家族樹"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Found an existing %s for this session. Click Create Synced Family Tree to "
"use it directly, or fill in the form above to generate a different key."
msgstr ""
"找到此工作階段既有的 %s。按一下「建立同步的家族樹」以直接使用，或填寫上方表單"
"以產生不同的金鑰。"

msgid "Please fill in the server URL, username, and password."
msgstr "請填寫伺服器 URL、使用者名稱和密碼。"

msgid "Generating API key…"
msgstr "正在產生 API 金鑰…"

#, python-format
msgid "Login failed (HTTP %d): check your username and password."
msgstr "登入失敗 (HTTP %d)：請檢查使用者名稱及密碼。"

#, python-format
msgid "Server returned an error (HTTP %d %s): check the Server URL."
msgstr "伺服器傳回錯誤 (HTTP %d %s)：請檢查伺服器網址。"

#, python-format
msgid "Could not reach the server: check the Server URL. (%s)"
msgstr "無法連線至伺服器：請檢查伺服器網址。(%s)"

#, python-format
msgid "Unexpected response from the server: %s"
msgstr "伺服器回應非預期的內容：%s"

#, python-format
msgid "Error: %s"
msgstr "錯誤：%s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Success. %s is now set for this Gramps session -- no restart needed. Copy "
"the key below to also set it in your shell environment for next time."
msgstr ""
"成功。此 Gramps 工作階段已設定 %s，無須重新啟動。請複製下方金鑰，也在 Shell "
"環境中設定，以便下次使用。"

msgid "Looking up account identity…"
msgstr "正在查詢帳號身分…"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A Family Tree named \"%s\" already exists. Open it from Family Trees -> "
"Manage Family Trees instead of creating another one."
msgstr ""
"名為「%s」的家族樹已存在。請從 [家族樹] -> [管理家族樹] 開啟，無須另建一棵。"

#, python-format
msgid "Error creating Family Tree: %s"
msgstr "建立家族樹時發生錯誤：%s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Created Family Tree \"%s\". Open it from Family Trees -> Manage Family Trees "
"to start syncing."
msgstr "已建立家族樹「%s」。請從 [家族樹] -> [管理家族樹] 開啟以開始同步。"

msgid ""
"Turn a Gramps Web API server URL, username, and password into a "
"GRAMPS_WEB_API_KEY value for GrampsWebApiDb, and optionally create a "
"matching, correctly-named GrampsWebApiDb Family Tree for it."
msgstr ""
"將 Gramps Web API 伺服器網址、使用者名稱及密碼轉換為 GrampsWebApiDb 使用的 "
"GRAMPS_WEB_API_KEY 值，並可選擇為其建立名稱正確且相符的 GrampsWebApiDb 家族"
"樹。"

msgid ""
"The account authenticating via GRAMPS_WEB_API_KEY does not have permission "
"on the server for this operation (HTTP 403 Forbidden). Generate a key for an "
"account with sufficient permissions, or ask the server administrator to "
"grant this one access."
msgstr ""
"透過 GRAMPS_WEB_API_KEY 驗證的帳號沒有在伺服器上執行此操作的權限（HTTP 403 "
"Forbidden）。請為具備足夠權限的帳號產生金鑰，或請伺服器管理員授予此帳號存取"
"權。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"This Family Tree is named \"%(actual)s\", but GRAMPS_WEB_API_KEY currently "
"authenticates as \"%(expected)s\". Rename this Family Tree to "
"\"%(expected_typeable)s\" (Family Trees -> Manage Family Trees) if it's "
"meant to mirror that account, or open/create the Family Tree already named "
"that -- reusing this one would mix its existing local data with the other "
"account's."
msgstr ""
"此家族樹名為 \"%(actual)s\"，但 GRAMPS_WEB_API_KEY 目前驗證的帳號是 "
"\"%(expected)s\"。如果此家族樹是要與該帳號的資料保持一致，請將它重新命名為 "
"\"%(expected_typeable)s\"（Family Trees -> Manage Family Trees）；或者開啟或"
"建立名稱相同的家族樹——繼續使用此家族樹，會將其既有的本機資料與另一個帳號的資"
"料混在一起。"

msgid "Retry local change after server conflict"
msgstr "伺服器衝突後重試本機變更"

msgid "Clear local mirror before full resync"
msgstr "完整重新同步前清除本機鏡像"

msgid "GrampsWebApiDb"
msgstr "GrampsWebApiDb"

msgid "Gramps _Web API Database"
msgstr "Gramps _Web API 資料庫"

msgid ""
"Use a Gramps Web API server (e.g. gramps-connect or Gramps Web) as a live "
"database, mirrored locally for speed."
msgstr ""
"將 Gramps Web API 伺服器 (例如 gramps-connect 或 Gramps Web) 作為即時資料庫，"
"並在本機建立鏡像以提升速度。"
